*This dialogue scene should occur before the player starts their run (after selecting) "play" from the main menu. It occurs in Pandamonium, the capital city of Hell.
The player will have the option to skip the scene by pressing esc*

[START DIALOGUE]
BELIAL: Abaddon? What are you doing? I am your friend! Ever since this city was founded.
[PRESS ENTER]
Abaddon: **chuckles** there are no allies in Hell.
[PRESS ENTER]
BELIAL: What could you possibly stand to gain from killing us demonfolk; you are an Angel of Death. You need HUMAN blood to survive!
[PRESS ENTER]
Abaddon: It's not just about me anymore Belial.
[PRESS ENTER]
BELIAL: ...
[PRESS ENTER]
Abaddon: I have a child now. Born of human blood. She needs demon blood to survive. And her supply is draining rapidly.
[PRESS ENTER]
BELIAL: You can't have offspring!? Angels are... Wait... No, Abaddon... You didn't... A human??
[PRESS ENTER]
*screenshake*
BELIAL: NOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!!
[END]